Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.39,0:01:43.06,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【恐惧】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.54,0:01:44.95,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自己要消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:45.70,0:01:48.28,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}然而，我觉得这样的自己消失也没关系
