Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.43,0:10:02.93,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只是，你本身有范围和界线
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.34,0:10:04.03,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.54,0:10:05.31,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我的衣服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.77,0:10:06.41,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我的鞋子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.95,0:10:07.57,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我的房间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.69,0:10:10.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那些是我的一部分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.73,0:10:13.18,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}藉由你的意识串连在一起的东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.16,0:10:16.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}能感觉到“我”的东西就是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:17.12,0:10:18.93,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我只不过是我自身吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.87,0:10:21.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但我不明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.23,0:10:23.48,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我在哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.20,0:10:25.24,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我是什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:26.15,0:10:27.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我是什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.79,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【所以希望封闭心灵】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:30.33,0:10:32.64,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为没有人愿意了解我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:33.35,0:10:34.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你是笨蛋吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.79,0:10:36.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是理所当然的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.37,0:10:39.88,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有人了解你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:40.55,0:10:43.36,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为能安慰、理解你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.29,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只有你自己而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.15,0:10:48.31,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以要珍惜自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.82,0:10:51.74,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就算你们这么说，我还是没有自我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:52.00,0:10:53.35,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我不理解自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.59,0:10:55.29,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么可能珍惜呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.07,0:10:56.32,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【很不安啊】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.83,0:10:58.18,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}果然很不安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.73,0:10:59.69,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在的你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.40,0:11:02.31,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在的你四周的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.03,0:11:05.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在的你周围的环境
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.16,0:11:08.86,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有一个是永远不变的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.42,0:11:11.47,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你的时间总在流动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.72,0:11:14.56,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你的世界由连续变化所构成
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.17,0:11:17.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}更重要的是，只要你的心境不同
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.01,0:11:19.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}它们随时都会改变
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.00,0:11:20.50,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.62,0:11:22.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么都没有的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.42,0:11:24.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有人的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.41,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自由的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.22,0:11:27.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自由
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.83,0:11:30.85,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不被任何事物束缚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.23,0:11:32.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自由的世界哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.67,0:11:34.73,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这就是自由
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.36,0:11:37.23,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对，自由的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.92,0:11:39.62,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}相对，也什么都没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.33,0:11:41.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只要我不去想就没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:42.02,0:11:44.55,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对，只要你不去想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.85,0:11:46.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么这样…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.82,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么办才好，我不知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.45,0:11:49.24,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}觉得不安吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.64,0:11:51.26,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不知道自己的形象吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.67,0:11:53.04,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}太模糊不清了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.45,0:11:55.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么都无法掌握的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.71,0:11:56.92,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(472.5,918)}【那就是{\fs103.5}自由】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.90,0:11:59.43,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你可以随心所欲的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是，你很不安吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.22,0:12:04.47,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不知道该怎么做才好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.13,0:12:06.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我该怎么做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.71,0:12:07.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}施加约束
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.32,0:12:10.28,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}看，这样就有了天地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.78,0:12:13.41,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但这样就失去了一项自由
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:13.95,0:12:16.15,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你不得不站在地上了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.66,0:12:18.68,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是，你会感到安心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.03,0:12:21.43,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为自己的心轻松一点了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:21.81,0:12:22.70,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}然后试走几步
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:23.29,0:12:24.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那是你的意志
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.23,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是…我的意志
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.65,0:12:30.93,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有地面存在的只有你四周的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:31.42,0:12:34.21,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}虽然如此，你还是可以自由行动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.44,0:12:37.45,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只要你想，还能改变世界的位置
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.53,0:12:41.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}而且世界的位置也常常不是在同一个地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.58,0:12:43.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}会随着时间流逝不断改变
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.60,0:12:46.69,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你自身也是可以改变的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:47.63,0:12:52.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}造就你形态的是你自己的心和你周围的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.19,0:12:55.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这，毕竟是你的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.96,0:12:58.83,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你所认定的现实的模样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.11,0:13:00.32,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【那就是现实】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.27,0:13:01.93,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.65,0:13:03.87,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么都没有的空间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:04.58,0:13:05.61,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么都没有的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.72,0:13:08.45,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}除了我之外什么都没有的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.65,0:13:11.71,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我越来越不懂了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.36,0:13:13.91,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}感觉自己正消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.94,0:13:16.73,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}“我”这个存在正在渐渐消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.33,0:13:18.17,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【为什么？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:18.35,0:13:20.56,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为这里只有你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.94,0:13:22.26,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为只有我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.71,0:13:24.45,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果没有自己以外的存在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.93,0:13:27.44,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你就不会知道自己的形态
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.73,0:13:28.83,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自己的形态
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.93,0:13:30.35,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【自己的形态？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.17,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.60,0:13:34.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}看到别人的形态才能知道自己的形态
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.54,0:13:39.62,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}看到自己与别人之间的障壁，才能想象出自己的形态
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.13,0:13:43.38,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有别人的话，你就看不见自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.00,0:13:46.49,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为有别人在，自己才能存在不是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.20,0:13:49.74,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一个人不管到哪里，还是一个人不是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:50.60,0:13:52.41,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}世界都只有我一个人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.32,0:13:57.45,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}认识跟别人之间的差异才能塑造出自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.33,0:14:01.02,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}第一个别人是——母亲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.30,0:14:04.26,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}母亲跟你是不同的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.68,0:14:06.14,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对，我是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:07.00,0:14:11.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只是，别人也确实在塑造我心灵的模样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.30,0:14:13.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没错，碇真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.55,0:14:14.87,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你总算明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.23,0:14:16.29,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}笨蛋真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.33,0:14:24.88,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}终于醒了啊，笨蛋真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.51,0:14:27.50,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么啊，是明日香啊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.89,0:14:30.26,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:30.57,0:14:34.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为了让你不会迟到，我可是每天早上专程叫你起床
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.52,0:14:37.35,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这就是你感谢青梅竹马所该说的话吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.82,0:14:39.46,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}呃…谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.35,0:14:43.54,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那就让我再多睡一会吧…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.85,0:14:46.06,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在撒什么娇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:46.45,0:14:48.34,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是的，快点给我起床
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.66,0:14:53.37,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊——
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:53.76,0:14:54.87,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}H！笨蛋！变态
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.01,0:14:55.86,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真不敢相信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.90,0:14:58.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我有什么办法！现在是早上啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.16,0:15:02.49,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:58.87,0:15:01.76,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}日向：好，似乎连上中继站了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.97,0:15:03.35,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}外景主持伊吹小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.97,0:15:03.35,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}伊吹：是的，我是伊吹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:03.76,0:15:06.08,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}我正琢磨着现在樱花是不是还在开呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.16,0:15:07.82,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}入梅已经近在眼前了呐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.31,0:15:12.92,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}而就在这里，第 2 次东京塔内例行的徒步登塔活动即将开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.43,0:15:15.83,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}大家都正在专心地进行准备运动呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.06,0:15:17.06,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}来听一下他们有什么要说的吧
