Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.88,0:07:56.65,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}好きじゃない
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.00,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}朝
